might sound weird but first i wanna shout out jeff @chameleon_jeff. before the $HYPE tge he was writing insanely good threads on hft, and reading that from the guy who built a multi-billion dollar business is never a waste of time. for example, here’s his thread on why you should use rust for hft - https://t.co/2dS3WbNvAu

