@0xLUKE777crypt - literally a whole series on getting into market making, part one here - https://t.co/DGFrj6wu0k

@Tristan0x - guy from the bullet perp dex team, and he pulled the most gigachad move possible for growing a project: mm’d 10k up to 16k and started a series on how to mm on bulletxyz, part one - https://t.co/qjlsbRLFsS

@PlanemoTrading - been following this guy for a while. he’s basically got a treadfi-style saas but for stat arb, and sometimes drops useful arb posts. recently showed ~1k profit in a week off 10k - https://t.co/zZUmbcBeOd

@0xpsyche1 - great guy, found him through his post comparing latency across different hosting providers - https://t.co/ALW9oDe3oX

@annanay - ex-hft at major firms, now founder at qfex, shares different ideas from time to time. if you’re new to mm, highly recommend his almost hour-long podcast intro to the topic - https://t.co/PoHeXDH8h8

@0xevolve - tons of posts on rust/low-level hft, here’s one on config - https://t.co/LAku15UmGP

@supermomonga - cool japanese guy, recently wrote about self-improving software via ml - https://t.co/lXT616mQGh

@yourQuantGuy - insanely talented chinese guy, lots of arb-specific info. funding, prices, and once wrote about an interesting options arb situation - https://t.co/DC0QVtkWNH

@UST_mean - solid chinese guy, from what i get he’s fairly new to hft but posts a lot of useful stuff from personal experience, e.g. rust vs python for latency - https://t.co/pObdqibFYF

@Boywus - very strong chinese guy, tons of info on hft, market making, adverse selection, latency, lead-lag arb. here’s a detailed breakdown of anthropic pre-ipo and the spreads between markets - https://t.co/he6Y2Q6z07

@ApriloneHS - writes about his arb experience with actual numbers, e.g. results from farming arcus <> lighter rh arb - https://t.co/vsQfXgOlm6

@StepOneAi - straight up a goldmine of hft info, wrote a massive series, absolute gem. part one of his “high-frequency infrastructure” series - https://t.co/mhCSURvBS9

@0xDC_MA - super useful chinese account, not really about auto arb, more manual stuff, but he posts a ton of his experience and pretty much every arb trade he takes. here’s one on a ~5% price spread - https://t.co/oh3Y4ewblO

